      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STEELE WOLF (1) stuck on well last time to finish 1.75 lengths back in third (25.63) at this track in a Mix 5 over 457m. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Can measure up this time. WHISKEY SERVICE (6) jumped from a middle draw last time and could manage only fourth and beaten 3 lengths (25.85) at this track. Yet to win here but has run some good races. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Can figure in the finish. MUSCOVITE MICA (2) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 22.03 beating Spring Nick. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. One of the prime contenders. DUFFMAN (8) cannot be underestimated.",
